","w:几","w:年级","w:了"],"unitId":"l2-u54"},{"id":"s:l2:364","zh":"这是一年级的课本。","pinyin":"Zhè shì yī niánjí de kèběn.","en":"This is a first-grade textbook.","wordIds":["w:这","w:是","w:一","w:年级","w:的","w:课本"],"unitId":"l2-u54"},{"id":"s:l3:320","zh":"你走开！","pinyin":"Nǐ zǒu kāi!","en":"Go away!","wordIds":["w:你","w:走开"],"unitId":"l2-u54"}]}
